      "id": 0,
      "message": "\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5282843764451195532\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F96A5.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🖥\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e Don\u0026#39;t be surprised if you see tables, nested lists, inline media, formulas, headers and more in Telegram messages.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5312047639393480586\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9396.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e📖\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e We now support rich formatting for all chatbots.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5456312597273923475\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F94A8.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🔨\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e Start building! \u003ca href=\"https://core.telegram.org/bots/api#rich-message-formatting-options\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"return confirm(\u0026#39;Open this link?\\n\\n\u0026#39;+this.href);\"\u003eDocs for chatbot devs →\u003c/a\u003e",
